.DS_Store
# Run data: keep frozen thresholds and each run's report and context; never a run's store/ (AOF, acl.conf with passwords) or logs.
runs/*/*
!runs/thresholds/*
!runs/*/report.md
!runs/*/report.json
!runs/*/context.json
